e_Success\"] == true", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [45], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 30, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "!(BaseGame.Reform_Autocrat_CourtVote_Success == true)", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "(Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_Autocrat_CourtVote_Success\"] == true) == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [43], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 31, "actorId": 4, "speaker": "Petr Vectern", "title": "Petr Vectern: \"\"Our organization was flawed. Our p...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Our organization was flawed. Our party was not united. The very parliament we control has denied us the reforms.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 32, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition == true", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [33, 34], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 33, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition == true", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition\"] == true", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [35], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 34, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "!(BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition == true)", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "(Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition\"] == true) == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 35, "actorId": 4, "speaker": "Petr Vectern", "title": "Petr Vectern: \"\"Even though some people inside of...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Even though some people inside of us had hoped to see us fail at the Court... We did succeed.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [36], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 36, "actorId": 10, "speaker": "Narrator", "title": "Narrator: \"The cabinet members looked at each...\"", "dialogueText": "The cabinet members looked at each other. Petr glanced at Nia and Ciara.", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 37, "actorId": 10, "speaker": "Narrator", "title": "Narrator: \"The cabinet members looked at each...\"", "dialogueText": "The cabinet members looked at each other and eventually set their eyes on Nia.", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 38, "actorId": 4, "speaker": "Petr Vectern", "title": "Petr Vectern: \"\"The Supreme Court blocked us once...\"", "dialogueText": "\"The Supreme Court blocked us once again. Unfortunately, some people within our team had also worked towards this goal.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [37], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 39, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition == true", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [40, 41], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 40, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition == true", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition\"] == true", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [38], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 41, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "!(BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition == true)", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "(Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Nia_Opposition\"] == true) == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [46], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 42, "actorId": 5, "speaker": "Player", "title": "Player: \"\"We have successfully made changes...\"", "dialogueText": "\"We have successfully made changes to the Sordish Constitution. This is a historic accomplishment. Without this team, it couldn't have been possible.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [32], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 43, "actorId": 5, "speaker": "Player", "title": "Player: \"\"Sadly and for reasons outside of o...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Sadly and for reasons outside of our control, Sordland had plunged into violent terror in the beginning of our term. It became our duty to save Sordland. We all knew it was an emergency.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 44, "actorId": 5, "speaker": "Player", "title": "Player: \"\"As we all know, the state of emerg...\"", "dialogueText": "\"As we all know, the state of emergency that was declared against the chaos in the beginning of our term, is no longer in place.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 45, "actorId": 5, "speaker": "Player", "title": "Player: \"\"Sadly and for reasons outside of o...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Sadly and for reasons outside of our control, Sordland had plunged into violent terror in the beginning of our term. It became our duty to save Sordland. We all knew it was an emergency.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 46, "actorId": 4, "speaker": "Petr Vectern", "title": "Petr Vectern: \"\"The Supreme Court blocked us once...\"", "dialogueText": "\"The Supreme Court blocked us once again. Another stain on our democracy.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 47, "actorId": 5, "speaker": "Player", "title": "Player: \"\"As we all know, the beginning of o...\"", "dialogueText": "\"As we all know, the beginning of our term saw an extraordinary period of violence that led us to a state of emergency.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}, {"id"